<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH SELIKO CZK 42.6MLN 9MO GROSS PROFIT.</title>
<headline>CZECH SELIKO CZK 42.6MLN 9MO GROSS PROFIT.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for period ending</p>
<p>September 30, 1996: (in millions of crowns)</p>
<p> Gross profit	    42.569    vs    30.517</p>
<p> Operational profit   148.672    vs   136.122</p>
<p> Production	   1,301.516    vs   1,209.506</p>
<p> Sales of goods	  81.749    vs     101.999</p>
<p>Sales of own products</p>
<p>  and services	1,282.208    vs   1,204.355</p>
<p> Writeoffs		 43.547    vs	40.044</p>
<p> Assets		 2,482.869    vs   2,019.903</p>
<p> Basic capital	  575.106    vs     575.238</p>
<p>Note. Full company name is Seliko a.s., a food and beverage</p>
<p>maker.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
